{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらく弐  時かけそば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームら  3日目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ガンちゃんの落語の日でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らちゃん（私は、チームらをらちゃんと呼ぶ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は2日ぶりの公演だったし、落語だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く緊張半端なかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らちゃん自身も、生駒自身も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく頑張りましたとみんなで笑顔で終われたよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落語、凄く不安だった〜(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対噛むと思ったもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、生駒よりもファンの皆さんの方が不安がってそう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、時間無いって言いながら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習したもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと出来たよ(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり、自分を褒めない私が自分を褒めるのってなかなか無いよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたら、らちゃんが変えてくれたのかも(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな気がするよ(^-^)✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今日のお客様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇中の歌の時に盛り上がって下さって、凄く嬉しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの顔が見れるように、実は客席を一瞬明るくしたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その瞬間は、席の後ろの方に迷惑にならない様に手を振って下さいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュガースポットも、全力で手を振るからね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はコープスファミリーが観に来てくれたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/17/9535486/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/17/9535486/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/17/9535486/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美女に囲まれて、幸せなあたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/17/9535486/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの皆さん今日都合が合うなんてねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒は落語披露ってだけで緊張に押しつぶされそうだったのに！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロ集団が来るって言う現実にプラスで緊張したよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみんな褒めてくださった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´；ω；｀)うるうる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスファミリー大好きだーーー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は一旦お仕事して！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日またらちゃんになるよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しむよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ終わらないけど、千秋楽迎えたくないよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対泣く！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと泣く！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}